her words, $A\\cup B$ denotes the set of natural numbers that are either multiple of $4$ or multiple of $5.$ So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A\\cup B & =\\{4,8,12,16,20,…\\}\\cup \\{5,10,15,20,…\\} \\\\  & =\\{4,5,8,10,12,15,16,20,…\\}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
